{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/943615091/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1769790000000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.publishersweekly.com/pw/by-topic/industry-news/publisher-news/article/99293-last-call-for-mass-market-paperbacks.html\" target=\"_blank\">The mass market paperback is going away</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://davidoks.blog/p/a-lot-of-population-numbers-are-fake\" target=\"_blank\">How many people does the world have?</a></p>\r\n<p>3.<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.perplexity.ai/search/indias-first-ai-university-is-jDI6dTLIT2SwGnyofI6TCA#0\" target=\"_blank\"> India’s first AI university is opening</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/Jon_Hartley_/status/2016934650414059530?s=20\" target=\"_blank\">Bellman equations on ESPN</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AlexGodofsky/status/2016872854344679489?s=20\" target=\"_blank\">Yup</a> (cuss word behind this link).</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.sympatheticopposition.com/p/contra-ajeya-cotra-on-women-asking?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1016702&amp;post_id=185558248&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Should women ask men out?</a></p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://freesystems.substack.com/p/the-enlightened-absolutists\" target=\"_blank\">On the Claude constitution</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://zhengdongwang.com/2026/01/30/a-straussian-reading-of-the-adolescence-of-technology.html\" target=\"_blank\">a Straussian reading?</a></p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.americasquarterly.org/article/kasts-cabinet-set-to-confront-distinctly-political-challenges/\" target=\"_blank\">The Chilean cabinet under Kast</a>.</p>\r\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.moltbook.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Moltbook, the new social network for AIs</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/best-of-moltbook?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=89120&amp;post_id=186286950&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Astral Codex comments</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/ItakGol/status/2017195438311366838\" target=\"_blank\">another view</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/MattPRD/status/2017196605896794437\" target=\"_blank\">some more</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/suppvalen/status/2017241420554277251\" target=\"_blank\">then some</a>.</p>\r\n<p>10. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/01/30/opinion/david-brooks-leaving-columnist.html\" target=\"_blank\">David Brooks is leaving the NYT</a> (and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/nytdavidbrooks/status/2017222982121226305\" target=\"_blank\">moving full-time to Atlantic</a>, podcast also, the first link is NYT).</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/01/friday-assorted-links-558.html\">Friday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~http